      "rationale": "This is the recursive equation defining the mathematical row-water summary as head plus the summary of the remaining cells.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-98dd266f5d08677ee67ace7455996a9ff6126e987b4677512995573403be6538",
      "start_line": 12,
      "text": "  rule water(I, REST) => I +Int water(REST)"
