      "rationale": "This is the base equation defining the required-bucket summary for an empty sequence of rows.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-6383d0e05f23e001a089bd57bd449f97db8e1e39df694102b320098d6caec6a4",
      "start_line": 15,
      "text": "  rule requiredBuckets(.Rows, C) => 0"
